      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 0.5
      },
      "narrationTail": 6,
      "narration": "And some countries support multiple emergency numbers. For example, the United Kingdom uses {999|nine-nine-nine} and {112|one-one-two}. Here are some important emergency numbers you may encounter around the world.",
