    },
    {
      "id": "s31-travel",
      "type": "title",
      "duration": 3,
      "narration": "And this is why travelers should check the local emergency number before visiting another country. The number that saves a life in one country might do absolutely nothing in another.",
      "data": {
        "kicker": "Before you travel",
        "title": "Check the local number.",
        "cue": "check"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s32-one-number",
      "type": "steps",
      "duration": 3,
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 0.5
      },
      "narration": "One of the biggest advantages of systems like 911 is that you don't necessarily have to know which emergency service you need. You explain what is happening. The call-taker can determine what kind of response is required and dispatch the appropriate emergency services.",
      "data": {
        "kicker": "Part 10",
        "heading": "One number, every service",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Caller",
            "text": "Explains what is happening",
            "cue": "explain"
          },
          {
            "title": "Call-taker",
            "text": "Decides the response",
            "cue": "call-taker"
          },
          {
            "title": "Police \u00b7 Fire \u00b7 EMS",
            "text": "Dispatched",
            "cue": "dispatch"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s33-real-power",
      "type": "photo",
      "duration": 3,
      "narration": "That's the real power of a universal emergency number. It's not just about remembering three digits. It's about removing a decision from someone who may already be panicking.",
      "data": {
        "media": "dispatcher",
        "heading": "Removing a decision",
        "cue": "removing"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s34-recap",
