      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 0.5
      },
      "narrationTail": 18,
      "narration": "So let's recap.",
      "data": {
        "style": "numbered",
        "kicker": "Part 11",
        "heading": "The big takeaway",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "911 was introduced in the United States in 1968."
          },
          {
            "text": "Before 911, people generally had to contact local emergency services directly or use a telephone operator."
