          {
            "text": "911 was created because emergency communication needed to be faster, simpler and more universal."
          },
          {
            "text": "The UK does not use 911 as its primary emergency number. It uses 999 and 112."
          },
          {
            "text": "911 existed 33 years before the September 11 attacks."
          },
          {
            "text": "The similarity between 911 and 9/11 is a coincidence."
          },
          {
            "text": "Other countries use 911, but emergency numbers vary around the world."
          }
        ]
